<title>USA: N.Y. CERT COTTON STOCKS DROP 292 BALES TO 95,587.</title>
<headline>N.Y. CERT COTTON STOCKS DROP 292 BALES TO 95,587.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Aug 7 totaled 95,587 bales, down from 95,879 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 292 cancellations, and 1,121 decertification orders.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
